		"request": "`GET / HTTP/1.1` — the most common thing a TLS port is sent by mistake",
		"request_hex": "474554202f20485454502f312e310d0a486f73743a206c6f63616c686f73740d0a0d0a",
		"response": "The connection is closed. A fatal alert first is nicer but optional: the peer is not speaking TLS and will not understand it either way.",
